Sounds like a problem with the save file location.
The _default_ is with the executable, but more usual
is in a directory named "save" under that one. To
check, move it down there by hand. If that works,
check the setup file to see that the setting for
SAVEDIR is 1) enabled, and 2) set to something
sensible.

